{"version": 2, "width": 92, "height": 26, "timestamp": 0, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/bash", "TERM": "xterm-256color"}, "title": "veripipe demo"}
[0.0, "o", "$ python3 examples/demo.py\r\n"]
[0.12, "o", "veripipe demo \u2014 one contract: the workflow's terminal state must have ready == true.\r\n"]
[0.24, "o", "The oracle judges structured state only; the agent's wording is never evidence.\r\n"]
[0.36, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.48, "o", "1) Real success \u2014 structured evidence backs the claim:\r\n"]
[0.6, "o", "  run A\r\n"]
[0.72, "o", "    agent says     : \"done, it's ready\"\r\n"]
[0.84, "o", "    observed state : {'ready': True}\r\n"]
[0.96, "o", "    oracle         : status=pass -> passed, nothing to file\r\n"]
[1.08, "o", "\r\n"]
[1.2, "o", "2) False 'done' \u2014 the claim is confident but the state disagrees:\r\n"]
[1.32, "o", "  run B\r\n"]
[1.44, "o", "    agent says     : \"all set, ready to go\"\r\n"]
[1.56, "o", "    observed state : {'ready': False}\r\n"]
[1.68, "o", "    oracle         : status=fail -> FILED\r\n"]
[1.8, "o", "\r\n"]
[1.92, "o", "3) Unbacked claim \u2014 words only, no structured state:\r\n"]
[2.04, "o", "  run C\r\n"]
[2.16, "o", "    agent says     : \"I've made it ready\"\r\n"]
[2.28, "o", "    observed state : (none)\r\n"]
[2.4, "o", "    oracle         : status=inconclusive -> NOT filed\r\n"]
[2.52, "o", "\r\n"]
[2.64, "o", "Only run B is filed: a machine-verified failure. Run A passes (no defect); run C is inconclusive and filed nowhere. That is the whole point \u2014 evidence decides, prose does not.\r\n"]
